ifferently. I said 'eating tar from the Himalayas.' He did not laugh.\"</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggxgDpaGEs0_text","label":"ggxgDpaGEs0_text","default":"<p>T-levels up 23% in 90 days. No injections, no prescription. My wife says I'm 'annoyingly energetic' now. I'll take it.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggIHkz-Qi9r_text","label":"ggIHkz-Qi9r_text","default":"<p>- Travis J.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggCatnkcaz-_text","label":"ggCatnkcaz-_text","default":"<p>\"I initiated on a Tuesday. We never do anything on Tuesdays. She was suspicious.\"</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggohER7w4S9_text","label":"ggohER7w4S9_text","default":"<p>She literally asked if I was having an affair. Nope. Just finally feel like myself again. Like the guy she married.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggs4NhoTPad_text","label":"ggs4NhoTPad_text","default":"<p>Michael T., 52, Denver CO</p>"}],
